  <bp:ProteinReference xmlns:bp="http://www.biopax.org/release/biopax-level3.owl#" xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" rdf:ID="ProteinReference22">
    <bp:organism rdf:resource="#BioSource1" />
    <bp:name rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">UniProt:Q8NI22 MCFD2</bp:name>
    <bp:name rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">MCFD2</bp:name>
    <bp:name rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">SDNSF</bp:name>
    <bp:xref rdf:resource="#UnificationXref170" />
    <bp:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">FUNCTION The MCFD2-LMAN1 complex forms a specific cargo receptor for the ER-to-Golgi transport of selected proteins. Plays a role in the secretion of coagulation factors.SUBUNIT Interacts in a calcium-dependent manner with LMAN1.INTERACTION Essentially unstructured in the absence of calcium ions. Requires calcium ions for folding.DISEASE The disease is caused by variants affecting the gene represented in this entry.</bp:comment>
  </bp:ProteinReference>
