    <bp:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">FUNCTION Plays a role in SNARE-pin assembly and Golgi-to-ER retrograde transport via its interaction with COG4. Involved in vesicular transport between the endoplasmic reticulum and the Golgi (By similarity).SUBUNIT Interacts with STX17. Interacts with STX5A. Interacts with the COG complex via COG4 (By similarity).INTERACTION Belongs to the STXBP/unc-18/SEC1 family.</bp:comment>
